#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se-h743.rst:266
#: cd5a95a3de2d4f4b8988924f02eee508
msgid "SRXL2 requires a connection to TX1 and automatically provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` to “4”."
